Date: Thu, 14 Feb 2013 16:29:14 +0000
Subject: Latent variable model
Message-ID: <9C5SvITn_Bs.vfeuorttWgkJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/9C5SvITn_Bs/m/vfeuorttWgkJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
