a = -mu(sigmaS + mu^2 -mu)/sigmaS
b = (sigmaS + mu^2 -mu)(mu - 1)/sigmaS

The next level up in hierarchy thus has priors for mu and sigmaS:
mu ~ Beta(1,1)
sigmaS ~ Gamma(c,d)

