In-Reply-To: <TjQ9TPUGmrs.DDVaKMRm568J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <TjQ9TPUGmrs.-7fB9DzxU9UJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <TjQ9TPUGmrs.DDVaKMRm568J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/TjQ9TPUGmrs/m/9aif7JAc0iQJ>
